            <h3>Meaning Unit Extraction</h3>
            <span class="step-subtitle">[SCRIPT: run_extract_cluster.py] One agent reads study context, then breaks every response into the smallest distinct ideas</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-toggle">+</div>
